<title>NEW ZEALAND: New Zealand vehicle registrations rise in March.</title>
<headline>New Zealand vehicle registrations rise in March.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The total number of vehicle registrations in New Zealand in March was 19,464, up from 19,205 in February and compared to 21,123 in March 1996, the Land Transport Safety Authority said on Friday.</p>
<p>Registrations of new and ex-overseas vehicles totalled 17,944 in March, versus 17,633 last month and 19,488 in March 1996. -- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
